  "title": "UK Graduate Visa Shortened – What You Need to Know",
  "slug": {
    "_type": "slug",
    "current": "uk-graduate-route-visa-reduced-2025"
  },
  "publishedAt": "2025-05-13T05:39:22",
  "excerpt": "The UK government has just released a major immigration white paper with significant changes for international students. These updates aim [&hellip;]",
  "content": [
    {
      "_key": "c11ea3979a05",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3def50df3376",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK government has just released a major immigration white paper with significant changes for international students. These updates aim to reduce net migration and tighten visa rules. Here’s what you need to know if you’re planning to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "a2b04c7670da",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "study in the UK"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a29e0cae71ad",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or are already there."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e2d35876df93",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "3bf2a3f93a43",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Graduate Route Now Only 18 Months"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2652e4aec410",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "89d272695e47",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "One of the biggest changes is to the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "89bc230cdf51",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "UK Graduate Route"
        },
        {
          "_key": "3829e051dda9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". Previously, international students could stay and work in the UK for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "d66b45353fc2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "2 years"
        },
        {
          "_key": "d048da520ec3",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " after completing their degree. That period is now reduced to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1f13e40e0839",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "18 months"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fe51efaf78d6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "389eb725b6c9",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4a6ac96af523",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "This visa still doesn’t require you to have a job offer right after graduation, but the government has hinted that more conditions could be added in the future to ensure graduates “work and contribute.”"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7beb6f942cc6",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "83a2348ddc19",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Stricter Rules for UK Universities and Colleges"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "09d28dac4ac0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "222125ca9dee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "UK universities that sponsor international students must now meet tougher standards:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e7341aa707a2",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "458b3a480c1f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "At least 95% of international students must enroll in their courses"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c4fe97d11d25",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "86d3276e8101",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "At least 90% must complete their programs"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "74a8d9895738",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "1d4e3fdc9e76",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "A new "
        },
        {
          "_key": "52d52a4f4877",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Red-Amber-Green rating system"
        },
        {
          "_key": "bff6bdb747a2",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " will help the government track which institutions are meeting these compliance standards."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "ad715bd01795",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "90906466ccb6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Agent Quality Framework Now Mandatory"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "f3de2333a69a",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d53ea0c79839",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Universities using "
        },
        {
          "_key": "4bff62d4e912",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "education agents"
        },
        {
          "_key": "437034901764",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to recruit students must follow the "
        },
        {
          "_key": "bd9887c674d6",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Agent Quality Framework (AQF)"
        },
        {
          "_key": "7f3a5a78c8a5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". This ensures agents are transparent and ethical in helping students apply to UK institutions."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7ddb847e2b0b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b0dfbd81f5d5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "New English Requirements for Student Dependants"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "e6a4bdd6362c",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "60727592ef55",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "International students’ "
        },
        {
          "_key": "35dd6b3e9e8b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "adult dependents"
        },
        {
          "_key": "796defebda91",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " must now prove basic English skills (A1 level) when entering the UK. Over time, they must show improvement to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "1b17c2360fda",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "A2 and B2 levels"
        },
        {
          "_key": "8d89e34e6c2c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " for visa extensions or permanent settlement."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "136e5b494c45",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "142498a5989c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Higher English Levels for Skilled Workers"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a35a2e4f9ec1",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "58ae6c1fe5e1",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you’re planning to apply for a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "300f554828ee",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "Skilled Worker Visa"
        },
        {
          "_key": "c46dc15b8cb9",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", the English level requirement has been increased from "
        },
        {
          "_key": "77fc8e2b70d0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "B1 to B2"
        },
        {
          "_key": "a9419131ab34",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". This aligns with the UK’s focus on welcoming "
        },
        {
          "_key": "93680ffc1df0",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "highly skilled professionals"
        },
        {
          "_key": "41cba2459399",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " like doctors, engineers, and AI experts."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "2401999a8cd0",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fb5bbab7b722",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short-Term English Courses Under Review"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "855b66b8d362",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "95c831a42260",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Short-term study visas for English learners (6–11 months) are being reviewed. Only accredited and well-monitored institutions will be allowed to sponsor such students."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "09cdcdc47823",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "4b9ff0ef1bfc",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Possible 6% Levy on International Student Fees"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "99e38f004282",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "2666548000ac",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "The UK government is also considering a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "987cbbad3286",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "6% levy on tuition income from international students"
        },
        {
          "_key": "594c0f8cc7b5",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ". This money would be reinvested in the UK education and skills sector. More details are expected in the Autumn 2025 budget."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "744a2899662f",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "d5248fb1777c",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Settlement Rules Tightened"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "094e3062e88b",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "e47603c56965",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "No more automatic settlement after 5 years. Students or workers must now stay for "
        },
        {
          "_key": "6226cce2b98b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "10 years"
        },
        {
          "_key": "fe1fb1345028",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " or show a "
        },
        {
          "_key": "c818e04f608e",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "significant contribution to the UK economy and society"
        },
        {
          "_key": "97216fbe353b",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": " to be eligible for permanent residency or citizenship."
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "d8e91cafb616",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "b7000df8f37d",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "What This Means for Future UK Students"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "h3"
    },
    {
      "_key": "7409a8e3d6e4",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "52e5ca706655",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "If you’re planning to "
        },
        {
          "_key": "04a01eb4752f",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [
            "strong"
          ],
          "text": "study abroad in the UK"
        },
        {
          "_key": "976d7e171118",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": ", you’ll still have great opportunities, but now with more focus on:"
        }
      ],
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c509bd03efb3",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "fd07dd2e26fe",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "High-quality education providers"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "c78438dfd1d8",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "556453edebdf",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "English proficiency"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
    {
      "_key": "a06b710e7c93",
      "_type": "block",
      "children": [
        {
          "_key": "9a27f02965aa",
          "_type": "span",
          "marks": [],
          "text": "Career goals after graduation"
        }
      ],
      "level": 1,
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "markDefs": [],
      "style": "normal"
    },
